SalesOrder "1" -- "0..*" ReceiptConfirmation : receipt evidence
ReceiptConfirmation "1" *-- "1..*" ReceiptConfirmationItem : received quantities
ReceiptConfirmation "1" -- "0..*" ReceiptDiscrepancy : complaints
ReceiptDiscrepancy "1" *-- "1..*" ReceiptDiscrepancyItem : complaint items
Batch "0..1" -- "0..*" ReceiptDiscrepancyItem : affected batch
Batch "1" *-- "0..*" BatchQrLabel : trace labels
BatchQrLabel "1" -- "0..*" ReceiptConfirmationItem : scan evidence
UserAccount "1" -- "0..*" ReceiptDiscrepancy : reports or reviews
SalesOrder "1" -- "0..1" Payment : receivable
ReceiptDiscrepancy ..> AdjustReceivableData : approved adjustment
AdjustReceivableData ..> Payment : changes adjusted amount
Payment "1" -- "0..*" ManualRefund : refunds excess collection
SalesOrder "1" -- "0..*" ManualRefund : order refunds
UserAccount "1" -- "0..*" ManualRefund : creates submits verifies
ReceiptDiscrepancy ..> ComplaintResult : API projection
